angular.module('inventory-count-schedules').controller('InventoryCountSchedulesController', ['$scope', '$stateParams', 'Authentication', 'ConfirmModal', 'InventoryCountSchedules', 'ObjectId', 'FhdMessenger', 'NgTableParams', '$state', 'helper', function ($scope, $stateParams, Authentication, ConfirmModal, InventoryCountSchedules, ObjectId, FhdMessenger, NgTableParams, $state, helper) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.authentication = Authentication;
  vm.user = Authentication.user;
  vm.days = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7];
  vm.fineMoneys = [20000, 50000, 100000];
  vm.removeValueFromArray = helper.removeValueFromArray;
  vm.inventoryCountSchedule = {
    isSendSticket: true
  };

  vm.initCreateView = () => {
    vm.inventoryCountSchedule.closeTime = moment().endOf('hour').toDate();
    vm.inventoryCountSchedule.recurringPeriod = 'none';
  }; // Create new Inventory count schedule


  vm.create = function () {
    vm.waiting = true; // Create new Inventory count schedule object

    const inventoryCountSchedule = new InventoryCountSchedules(vm.inventoryCountSchedule);
    inventoryCountSchedule.outlets = _.map(inventoryCountSchedule.outlets, ObjectId.getObjectId); // Redirect after save

    inventoryCountSchedule.$save().then(function (response) {
      $state.go('listInventoryCountSchedules'); // Clear form fields

      vm.name = '';
    }).catch(FhdMessenger.errorFromServer).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  }; // Remove existing Inventory count schedule


  vm.remove = function (inventoryCountSchedule) {
    if (inventoryCountSchedule) {
      const index = _.find(vm.inventoryCountSchedules, {
        _id: inventoryCountSchedule._id
      });

      inventoryCountSchedule.$remove().then(() => {
        vm.inventoryCountSchedules.splice(index, 1);
        vm.schedulesTable.reload();
      });
    } else {
      vm.inventoryCountSchedule.$remove(function () {
        $state.go('listInventoryCountSchedules');
      });
    }
  }; // Remove existing Inventory count schedule


  vm.createInventoryCount = function (inventoryCountSchedule) {
    vm.waiting = true;
    inventoryCountSchedule.$createInventoryCount().then(() => {
      FhdMessenger.success('Tạo buổi kiểm hàng thành công cho ' + inventoryCountSchedule.name);
    }).catch(FhdMessenger.errorFromServer).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.productSelected = addingProduct => {
    vm.products = vm.products || [];

    const productIndex = _.findIndex(vm.products, existProduct => {
      return existProduct.sku === addingProduct.sku;
    });

    if (productIndex > -1) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Sản phẩm này đã tồn tại!');
    } else {
      vm.products.push(addingProduct);
    }
  };

  vm.removeProduct = index => {
    vm.products.splice(index, 1);
  }; // Update existing Inventory count schedule


  vm.update = function () {
    vm.waiting = true;
    const inventoryCountSchedule = vm.inventoryCountSchedule;
    inventoryCountSchedule.items = vm.products;

    if (_.get(vm.items, 'length')) {
      vm.inventoryCountSchedule.items = vm.items;
    }

    inventoryCountSchedule.$update().then(function () {
      FhdMessenger.success('Cập nhật thành công');
      $state.go('listInventoryCountSchedules');
    }).catch(FhdMessenger.errorFromServer).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.schedulesTable = new NgTableParams({
    count: 50
  }, {
    sorting: {
      created: 'desc'
    }
  }); // Find a list of Inventory count schedules

  vm.find = function () {
    InventoryCountSchedules.query().$promise.then(inventoryCountSchedules => {
      vm.inventoryCountSchedules = inventoryCountSchedules;

      _.forEach(vm.inventoryCountSchedules, inventoryCountSchedule => {
        const outletCodes = _.map(inventoryCountSchedule.outlets, 'code');

        const outletCodeString = outletCodes.join(', ');
        inventoryCountSchedule.outletCodeString = outletCodeString;
      });

      vm.schedulesTable.settings({
        dataset: vm.inventoryCountSchedules
      });
    });
  }; // Find existing Inventory count schedule


  vm.findOne = function () {
    InventoryCountSchedules.get({
      inventoryCountScheduleId: $stateParams.inventoryCountScheduleId
    }).$promise.then(inventoryCountSchedule => {
      vm.inventoryCountSchedule = inventoryCountSchedule;
      vm.products = inventoryCountSchedule.items;
    });
  };

  vm.requireFields = 'sku outletCode startDate numItemPerInventoryCount'.split(' ');

  function isAllValidField(field) {
    return _.some(vm.rawItems, item => {
      return !_.get(item, field);
    });
  }

  function validateItems(items) {
    let errors = [];

    _.forEach(vm.requireFields, requireField => {
      if (isAllValidField(requireField)) {
        errors.push(`Bạn chưa điền đủ ${requireField}`);
      }
    });

    return errors;
  }

  vm.import = () => {
    if (!vm.items.length) {
      return;
    }

    const errors = validateItems(vm.items);

    if (errors.length) {
      _.forEach(errors, err => {
        return FhdMessenger.error(err);
      });

      return;
    }

    ConfirmModal.showModal({}, {
      bodyText: `Hành động này sẽ import ${vm.items.length} items để tạo inventory count schedule?`,
      actionButtonText: 'Đồng ý',
      closeButtonText: 'Kiểm tra lại'
    }).then(() => {
      vm.waiting = true;
      InventoryCountSchedules.import({
        items: vm.items
      }).$promise.then(inventoryCountSchedule => {
        return FhdMessenger.success(`Import ${inventoryCountSchedule.length} Inventory Count Schedule thành công`);
      }).catch(err => {
        return FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(err);
      }).finally(() => {
        vm.waiting = false;
      });
    });
  };

  vm.updateIsSendUserNote = function () {
    if (vm.inventoryCountSchedule.isSendSticket) {
      vm.inventoryCountSchedule.isSendUserNote = false;
    }
  };

  vm.updateIsSendSticket = function () {
    if (vm.inventoryCountSchedule.isSendUserNote) {
      vm.inventoryCountSchedule.isSendSticket = false;
    }
  };
}]);
'use strict'; // Inventory count schedules service used to communicate Inventory count schedules REST endpoints

angular.module('inventory-count-schedules').factory('InventoryCountSchedules', ['$resource', function ($resource) {
  return $resource('inventory-count-schedules/:inventoryCountScheduleId', {
