angular.module('outlet-reports').controller('SummarizeOutletReportsController', ['$window', 'NgTableParams', 'OutletReportService', 'OnlineOrderService', 'Authentication', 'helper', 'ConfirmModal', 'FhdMessenger', 'OutletReports', '$http', 'ObjectId', '$stateParams', function ($window, NgTableParams, OutletReportService, OnlineOrderService, Authentication, helper, ConfirmModal, FhdMessenger, OutletReports, $http, ObjectId, $stateParams) {
