angular.module('products').controller('ModalImportCSVController', ['$scope', '$modalInstance', 'helper', 'ProductService', 'TsvToJson', 'FhdMessenger', 'NgTableParams', function ($scope, $modalInstance, helper, ProductService, TsvToJson, FhdMessenger, NgTableParams) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.products = [];
  vm.cols = [];
  vm.data = {};
  vm.waiting = true;
  ProductService.getAllProductsFromServer().then(products => {
    vm.data.productMap = helper.makeMap(products, 'sku');
    vm.waiting = false;
  });

  function indexCol($scope, row, rowIndex) {
    return `<span>${rowIndex + 1}</span>`;
  }

  function normalValue($scope, row) {
    const vm = this;

    let value = _.get(row, vm.field);

    if (!value) {
      value = 'Khác';
    }

    return `<span>${value}</span>`;
  }

  function generateHeaders(cols) {
    vm.cols = [{
      title: 'STT',
      show: true,
      getValue: indexCol
    }, {
      title: 'SKU',
      field: 'sku',
      show: true,
      getValue: normalValue
    }, {
      title: 'Description',
      field: 'description',
      show: true,
      getValue: normalValue
    }];

    _.each(cols, col => {
      if (col === 'sku' || col === 'description') return;
      return vm.cols.push({
        title: col,
        field: col,
        show: true,
        getValue: normalValue
      });
    });
  }

  $scope.$watch(() => vm.items, (newItems, oldItems) => {
    if (newItems === oldItems) return;
    if (!newItems.length) return;
    vm.products = [];

    const cols = _.keys(_.head(newItems));

    generateHeaders(cols);

    _.forEach(newItems, item => {
      const matchProduct = vm.data.productMap[item.sku];

      if (!matchProduct) {
        return FhdMessenger.error(`Mã ${item.sku} không tìm thấy sản phẩm tương ứng trên hệ thống.`);
      }

      const newProduct = _.assign({}, matchProduct, item, {
        product: matchProduct._id
      });

      vm.products.push(newProduct);
      vm.fetchTable();
    });
  });

  vm.fetchTable = () => {
    vm.productsTable = new NgTableParams({
      count: 1000
    }, {
      dataset: vm.products
    });
  };

  vm.close = () => {
    $modalInstance.dismiss();
  };

  vm.confirm = () => {
    $modalInstance.close(vm.products);
  };
}]);
'use strict';

angular.module('products').controller('ModalOpenEditPlDescriptionForProductController', ['$modalInstance', '$sce', 'FhdMessenger', 'product', 'Products', function ($modalInstance, $sce, FhdMessenger, product, Products) {
  const vm = this;

  vm.init = function () {
    vm.product = Products.get({
      productId: product._id
    });
    vm.modifyVideoLink();
  };

  vm.addImage = newImage => {
    vm.product.rawImages = vm.product.rawImages || [];

    if (newImage) {
      vm.product.rawImages.push({
        data: newImage
      });
    }
  };

  vm.removeImage = index => {
    vm.product.rawImages.splice(index, 1);
  };

  vm.update = function () {
    vm.product.$update(function () {
      FhdMessenger.success('Cập nhật thành công');
      $modalInstance.close();
    }, function (error) {
      FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(error);
    });
    $modalInstance.close();
  };

  vm.modifyVideoLink = function () {
    if (vm.product.plProperties) {
      if (vm.product.plProperties.video) {
        if (vm.product.plProperties.video.search('embed') === -1) {
          if (vm.product.plProperties.video.search('watch') === -1) {
            const url = vm.product.plProperties.video.replace('com', 'com/embed');
            vm.videoUrl = $sce.trustAsResourceUrl(url);
          } else {
            const url = vm.product.plProperties.video.replace('watch?v=', 'embed/');
            vm.videoUrl = $sce.trustAsResourceUrl(url);
          }
        } else {
          if (vm.product.plProperties.video.search('watch') === -1) {
            vm.videoUrl = $sce.trustAsResourceUrl(vm.product.plProperties.video);
          } else {
            const url = vm.product.plProperties.video.replace('embed/watch?v=', 'embed/');
            vm.videoUrl = $sce.trustAsResourceUrl(url);
          }
        }
      }
    }
  };

  vm.cancel = function () {
    $modalInstance.dismiss();
  }; // Insert in tab Pl


  vm.insertWrapper = wrapper => {
    vm.product.wrappers = vm.product.wrappers || [];
    vm.product.wrappers.push({
      product: wrapper._id,
      sku: wrapper.sku,
      description: wrapper.description,
      quantity: 1
    });
  };

  vm.insertLabel = label => {
    vm.product.labels = vm.product.labels || [];
    vm.product.labels.push({
      product: label._id,
      sku: label.sku,
      description: label.description,
      quantity: 1
    });
  };

  vm.insertTool = tool => {
    vm.product.tools = vm.product.tools || [];
    vm.product.tools.push({
      product: tool._id,
      sku: tool.sku,
      description: tool.description,
      quantity: 1
    });
  }; // Remove in tab Pl


  vm.removeWrapper = index => {
    if (!_.isArray(vm.product.wrappers)) return;
    vm.product.wrappers.splice(index, 1);
  };

  vm.removeLabel = index => {
    if (!_.isArray(vm.product.labels)) return;
    vm.product.labels.splice(index, 1);
  };

  vm.removeTool = index => {
    if (!_.isArray(vm.product.tools)) return;
    vm.product.tools.splice(index, 1);
  };
}]);
"use strict";

