angular.module('shift-records').controller('ModalCurrentShiftController', ['$scope', '$modalInstance', 'CalendarEntryService', 'ResourcesService', 'OutletService', 'Authentication', 'toaster', 'CurrentShift', 'UserService', 'OfflineMode', 'ObjectId', 'FhdMessenger', function ($scope, $modalInstance, CalendarEntryService, ResourcesService, OutletService, Authentication, toaster, CurrentShift, UserService, OfflineMode, ObjectId, FhdMessenger) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.offlineModeData = OfflineMode.offlineModeData;
  vm.data = {};
  vm.outlet = {};
  vm.user = Authentication.user;
  vm.addNewShiftRecord = false;

  vm.init = function () {
    vm.shiftRecord = {
      date: ResourcesService.currentDate(),
      staffs: []
    };
    vm.outlet = vm.user.outlet;
  };

  vm.staffSelected = function (staff) {
    vm.shiftRecord.staffs = vm.shiftRecord.staffs || [];
    vm.shiftRecord.staffs.push(staff);
    vm.data.staffSearch = undefined;
  };

  vm.removeStaff = function (index) {
    vm.shiftRecord.staffs.splice(index, 1);
  };

  vm.checkShiftRecord = function () {
    if (!_.get(vm.shiftRecord, 'outlet._id')) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Chưa chọn cơ sở trực');
    }

    var shiftRecord = vm.shiftRecord;
    vm.waiting = true;
    CurrentShift.checkShiftRecord({
      outlet: shiftRecord.outlet._id,
      date: shiftRecord.date,
      shift: shiftRecord.shift.code
    }).then(function (response) {
      if (response.exists === true) return $modalInstance.close(response.shiftRecord);else {
        const shiftEntry = response.shiftEntry;
        vm.shiftRecord = vm.shiftRecord || {};
        vm.shiftRecord.staffs = UserService.addFullDescription(shiftEntry.staffs);

        _.forEach(vm.shiftRecord.staffs, staff => {
          if (ObjectId.getObjectId(staff) === ObjectId.getObjectId(vm.user)) {
            staff.came = true;
          }
        });

        vm.addNewShiftRecord = true;
      }
    }, function (err) {
      if (err) toaster.error(err.data ? err.data.message : err.message || 'Có lỗi phát sinh');
    }).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.loginCalendarEntry = function () {
    vm.waiting = true;
    CurrentShift.loginCalendar({
      outletId: vm.outlet._id
    }).then(calendar => {
      vm.calendarEntry = calendar;

      if (_.get(calendar, 'outlet.code', '').match(/S\d+/)) {
        vm.missions = _.map(CalendarEntryService.getMissions(), mission => {
          return {
            name: mission,
            done: false
          };
        });
      }
    }).catch(error => {
      FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(error);
    }).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.canMarkCame = function (staff) {
    if (!vm.shiftRecord) {
      return true;
    }

    if (!_.get(vm, 'shiftRecord.shiftRecordId', '').match(/D\d+/) && !_.get(vm, 'shiftRecord.outlet.code', '').match(/D\d+/)) {
      return true;
    }

    if (!ObjectId.equals(staff, vm.user)) {
      return false;
    }

    return true;
  };

  vm.createShiftRecord = function () {
    if (vm.shiftRecord.outlet.code.match(/^[EMSK]\d+/) && !vm.shiftRecord.initialPettyCash || vm.shiftRecord.outlet.code.match(/B[25]/) && !_.isNumber(vm.shiftRecord.initialPettyCash)) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Chưa có tiền lẻ đầu ca');
    }

    const shiftRecord = CurrentShift.newShiftRecord(vm.shiftRecord);
    vm.waiting = true;
    CurrentShift.createShiftRecord(shiftRecord).then(function (response) {
      $modalInstance.close(response);
    }, function (err) {
      toaster.error(err.message || err.data.message);
    }).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.createOfflineShiftRecord = function () {
    if (!vm.shiftRecord.date) {
      FhdMessenger.error('Thiếu ngày');
      return;
    }

    if (!vm.shiftRecord.outlet) {
      FhdMessenger.error('Thiếu cơ sở');
      return;
    }

    if (!vm.shiftRecord.shift) {
      FhdMessenger.error('Thiếu ca trực');
      return;
    }

    if (!vm.data.offlineUser) {
      FhdMessenger.error('Thiếu người trực');
      return;
    }

    const date = moment(vm.shiftRecord.date);
    const dateFormat = date.format('YYYY-MM-DD');
    const outlet = vm.shiftRecord.outlet;

    const outletCode = _.get(outlet, 'code');

    const shift = _.get(vm.shiftRecord, 'shift.code');

    const shiftRecord = {
      _id: 'auto',
      shiftRecordId: `${outletCode}_${dateFormat}_${shift}`,
      created: new Date(),
      date: date.toDate(),
      shift,
      outlet,
      staffs: [],
      offlineUser: vm.data.offlineUser
    };
    CurrentShift.setCurrentShift(shiftRecord);
    $modalInstance.close(shiftRecord);
  };

  vm.cancel = function () {
    $modalInstance.dismiss('Done!');
  };
}]);
