angular.module('stock-entries').controller('ModalUpdateFeedbackController', ['$scope', 'stockEntry', '$http', 'FhdMessenger', '$modalInstance', 'CurrentShift', 'Authentication', 'UserPhotoService', 'StockEntryService', function ($scope, stockEntry, $http, FhdMessenger, $modalInstance, CurrentShift, Authentication, UserPhotoService, StockEntryService) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.stockEntry = stockEntry;
  vm.items = [];
  vm.feedbackImages = [];
  vm.user = Authentication.user;

  if (vm.user.roles.includes('admin')) {
    vm.staff = vm.user;
  }

  function checkValidItems(items) {
    const negativeItem = _.find(items, item => item.countQuantity < 0);

    if (negativeItem) return `Sản phẩm ${negativeItem.sku} ${negativeItem.description} không thể có số lượng nhỏ hơn 0`;
    return null;
  }

  vm.choosePhotos = () => {
    UserPhotoService.view().then(photos => {
      photos.forEach(photo => vm.feedbackImages.push({
        link: photo.link
      }));
    });
  };

  vm.updateFeedback = function (stockEntry) {
    const feedbackContent = _.get(stockEntry, 'feedback.content');

    if (!feedbackContent && !vm.items.length) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Nội dung trống');
    }

    if (!vm.staff) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Chưa có nhân viên kiểm hàng');
    }

    if (_.get(vm.stockEntry, 'items.length') === _.get(vm.items, 'length') && _.every(vm.items, item => {
      return item.countQuantity === 0;
    })) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Nếu CS không nhận được LE này hãy ấn nút Hàng không về nhé!');
    }

    if (_.some(vm.rawItems, item => {
      return !_.isNumber(item.quantity);
    })) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Có sản phẩm hàng RAW chưa nhập số thực tế dùng được');
    }

    if (_.get(vm.stockEntry, 'destination.code', '').match(/[ME]\d+/) && _.get(vm.feedbackImages, 'length') < _.filter(vm.items, item => {
      return item.note;
    }).length) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Số lượng ảnh phải tương ứng với số sản phẩm có vấn đề khác');
    }

    const currentShift = CurrentShift.getCurrentShift();
    const outlet = currentShift.outlet ? currentShift.outlet._id : null;
    const shift = currentShift.shift || undefined;
    stockEntry.newStatus = {
      status: 'received',
      staff: vm.user._id,
      outlet,
      shift
    };
    stockEntry.feedbackImages = vm.feedbackImages;
    stockEntry.rawItems = vm.rawItems;
    stockEntry.wrongItems = vm.items;
    stockEntry.checkStaff = vm.staff._id;
    const error = checkValidItems(stockEntry.wrongItems);
    if (error) return FhdMessenger.error(error);
    vm.updating = true;
    return stockEntry.$receive().then(function () {
      FhdMessenger.success('Gửi thành công');
      $modalInstance.close();
    }).catch(function (error) {
      FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(error);
    }).finally(() => {
      vm.updating = false;
    });
  };

  vm.updateNoProblem = function () {
    if (vm.noProblem) {
      vm.stockEntry.feedback = vm.stockEntry.feedback || {};
      vm.stockEntry.feedback.content = 'Không có vấn đề';
      vm.items = [];
    }
  };

  vm.calculateRawProduct = function () {
    vm.rawItems = [];

    if (_.get(vm.stockEntry, 'destination.code') === 'G4') {
      return;
    }

    if (!_.get(vm.stockEntry, 'destination.code').match(/G\d+/)) {
      return;
    }

    if (vm.stockEntry.type !== 'recycle' && !_.some(vm.stockEntry.items, item => item.sku.match(/B\d+/) && _.some(item.rawProducts, {
      quantity: 0
    }))) {
      return;
    }

    _.forEach(vm.stockEntry.items, item => {
      if (!_.get(item, 'product.rawProducts.length')) {
        return;
      }

      const matchItem = _.find(vm.items, {
        sku: item.sku
      });

      if (!matchItem) {
        _.forEach(item.product.rawProducts, rawProduct => {
          vm.rawItems = addItemToRawItem(rawProduct, item, vm.rawItems);
        });
      }
    });

    _.forEach(vm.items, item => {
      if (!_.get(item, 'rawProducts.length')) {
        return;
      }

      _.forEach(item.rawProducts, rawProduct => {
        vm.rawItems = addItemToRawItem(rawProduct, item, vm.rawItems);
      });
    });
  };

  function addItemToRawItem(rawProduct, item, rawItems) {
    const quantity = rawProduct.quantity * (item.quantity || item.countQuantity);

    const matchItem = _.find(vm.rawItems, {
      sku: rawProduct.sku
    });

    if (matchItem) {
      matchItem.quantity += quantity;
    } else {
      rawItems.push({
        product: rawProduct.product,
        sku: rawProduct.sku,
        description: rawProduct.description,
        quantity
      });
    }

    return rawItems;
  }

  vm.addItem = function (product) {
    // Đoạn dưới để check xem sản phẩm add vào có thực sự restock từ cơ sở
    // gửi hay không. (Chỉ áp dụng với Savor, dùng tags để xem cơ sở restock)
    const destinationCode = _.get(vm.stockEntry, 'destination.code', '');

    const outletCode = _.get(vm.stockEntry, 'outlet.code', '');

    if (product.sku.match(/R\d+/) && !outletCode.match(/(G\d+|B4|B1)/)) {
      return FhdMessenger.error(`Mã R chỉ được thêm vào cho LE chuyển từ cơ sở DG`);
    }

    if (angular.isString(destinationCode) && destinationCode.match(/^S\d/) && outletCode.match(/B\d+/)) {
      const outletCodes = _.compact(_.map(_.get(product, 'tags'), tag => {
        if (tag && angular.isString(tag)) {
          const match = tag.match(/Restock (\w\d+)/);
          if (match && match[1]) return match[1];
        }

        return null;
      }));

      const sourceCode = _.get(vm.stockEntry, 'outlet.code');

      if (outletCodes && outletCodes.length > 0 && !outletCodes.includes(sourceCode) && !_.includes(vm.stockEntry.items, item => item.sku === product.sku)) {
        FhdMessenger.error(`${sourceCode} không phụ trách restock mặt hàng ${product.sku} ${product.description}.`);
        return;
      }
    }

    const index = _.findIndex(vm.items, {
      product: product._id
    });

    if (index > -1) {
      return;
    }

    vm.items.push({
      product: product._id,
      sku: product.sku,
      description: product.description,
      privateLabel: product.privateLabel,
      rawProducts: product.rawProducts,
      cogs: product.cogs,
      price: product.price
    });
    vm.calculateRawProduct();
  };

  vm.remove = function (item) {
    const index = _.findIndex(vm.items, {
      product: item.product
    });

    if (index > -1) {
      vm.items.splice(index, 1);
    }
  };

  vm.addImage = newImage => {
    vm.feedbackImages = vm.feedbackImages || [];

    if (newImage) {
      vm.feedbackImages.push({
        data: newImage
      });
    }
  };

  vm.removeImage = index => {
    vm.feedbackImages.splice(index, 1);
  };

  vm.dismiss = function () {
    $modalInstance.dismiss();
  };

  vm.selectProblem = function (item) {
    StockEntryService.openModalSelectProblem(item).then(result => {
      if (!result) {
        return;
      }

      Object.assign(item, result);
    });
  };
}]);
"use strict";

angular.module('stock-entries').controller('ModalViewStockEntryController', ['StockEntries', '$modalInstance', 'BuyingEntries', 'stockEntryId', 'NgTableParams', 'CurrentShift', 'StockEntryService', 'Authentication', '$http', 'FhdMessenger', 'ConfirmModal', function (StockEntries, $modalInstance, BuyingEntries, stockEntryId, NgTableParams, CurrentShift, StockEntryService, Authentication, $http, FhdMessenger, ConfirmModal) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.user = Authentication.user;
  vm.modal = $modalInstance;

  vm.dismiss = () => $modalInstance.dismiss();

  vm.close = () => $modalInstance.close();

  vm.stockEntry = StockEntries.get({
    stockEntryId
  });
  vm.itemsTable = new NgTableParams({
    count: 50
  }, {
    sorting: {
      description: 'asc'
    }
  });
  vm.newItemsTable = new NgTableParams({
    count: 50
  }, {
    sorting: {
      description: 'asc'
    }
  });
  vm.stockEntry.$promise.then(stockEntry => {
    vm.itemsTable.settings({
      dataset: stockEntry.items
    });
    vm.newItemsTable.settings({
      dataset: stockEntry.newItems
    });
  });

  vm.updateFeedback = function (stockEntry, newStatus) {
    const modal = StockEntryService.openUpdateFeedback(stockEntry, newStatus);
    modal.result.then(function () {
      FhdMessenger.success('Ok');
    });
  };

  vm.confirmReceived = function () {
    vm.updateFeedback(vm.stockEntry, 'received');
  };

  vm.remove = StockEntryService.openDeleteStockEntryModal;
}]);
"use strict";

angular.module('stock-entries').controller('QuickCreateStockEntryModalController', ['data', 'OnlineOrders', '$modalInstance', 'FhdMessenger', 'ObjectId', function (data, OnlineOrders, $modalInstance, FhdMessenger, ObjectId) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.outletCode = data.outletCode;
  vm.destinationCode = data.destinationCode;
  vm.items = data.items;

  vm.submit = () => {
    vm.waiting = true;
    const stockEntryObj = {
      items: data.items,
      outletCode: data.outletCode,
      destinationCode: data.destinationCode
    };

    if (data.onlineOrder) {
      OnlineOrders.createStockEntry({
        onlineOrderId: ObjectId.getObjectId(data.onlineOrder)
      }, stockEntryObj).$promise.then(() => {
        FhdMessenger.success('Ok');
        $modalInstance.close();
      }).catch(FhdMessenger.errorFromServer).finally(() => {
        vm.waiting = false;
      });
      return;
    }

    FhdMessenger.error('No online order found');
  };

  vm.addItem = function (product) {
    const item = _.find(vm.items, {
      product: product._id
    });

    if (item) {
      item.quantity += 1;
      return;
    }

    vm.items.push({
      product: product._id,
      sku: product.sku,
      description: product.description,
      quantity: 1
    });
  };

  vm.remove = function (item) {
    const index = _.findIndex(vm.items, {
      product: item.product
    });

    if (index > -1) {
      vm.items.splice(index, 1);
    }
  };

  vm.dismiss = () => {
    $modalInstance.dismiss();
  };
}]);
'use strict'; // Logistics Entries controller

angular.module('stock-entries').controller('StockEntriesNeedBuyingEntryController', ['FhdMessenger', 'NgTableParams', 'StockEntries', 'StockEntryService', function (FhdMessenger, NgTableParams, StockEntries, StockEntryService) {
