angular.module('support-entries').controller('SupportEntriesController', ['Authentication', '$state', 'CurrentShift', 'NgTableParams', 'OutletService', 'SupportEntries', 'SupportOptions', 'SupportEntryService', 'FhdMessenger', 'ObjectId', function (Authentication, $state, CurrentShift, NgTableParams, OutletService, SupportEntries, SupportOptions, SupportEntryService, FhdMessenger, ObjectId) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.supportEntry = {};
  vm.user = Authentication.user;
  vm.data = {};
  vm.waiting = false;
  vm.openModalUpdateSupportEntry = SupportEntryService.openModalUpdateSupportEntry;
  const seeAllRoles = ['admin', 'hau-can'];

  function loadOutlet() {
    OutletService.allAsync().then(result => {
      vm.data.outlets = result;
      vm.data.outlets = _.filter(vm.data.outlets, outlet => {
        if (outlet.hasStaff) {
          return true;
        }
      });
      vm.showOutletMap = _.reduce(vm.data.outlets, (result, outlet) => {
        if (_.intersection(vm.user.roles, seeAllRoles).length > 0 || ObjectId.equals(outlet, vm.user.outlet)) {
          result[outlet._id] = true;
        }

        return result;
      }, {});
      vm.enableOutletMap = _.clone(vm.showOutletMap);
    });
  }

  function loadStatus() {
    vm.statusMap = {
      created: true,
      processing: true,
      done: false
    };
  }

  vm.init = () => {
    const currentShift = CurrentShift.getCurrentShift();
    vm.outlet = currentShift.outlet;
    loadOutlet();
    loadStatus();
  };

  vm.findSupportOptions = function () {
    FhdMessenger.info('Đang tìm...');
    vm.supportOptions = SupportOptions.query();
    vm.supportOptions.$promise.then(() => {
      vm.problemOptions = vm.supportOptions;
      FhdMessenger.success('Tải xong');
    });
  }; // Create new Support Entry


  vm.create = function () {
    // Create new Support Entry object
    if (!vm.problemSelected) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Vui lòng chọn vấn đề cần giải quyết');
    }

    if (!vm.supportEntry.title) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Vui lòng nhập tiêu đề ngắn gọn');
    }

    if (!vm.supportEntry.outlet) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Vui lòng chọn cơ sở');
    }

    if (_.intersection(vm.user.roles, ['admin']).length && !ObjectId.equals(vm.supportEntry.outlet, vm.user.outlet) && !_.some(vm.user.managingOutlets, outlet => {
      return ObjectId.equals(outlet, vm.supportEntry.outlet);
    })) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Bạn chỉ được tạo Support Entry cho cơ sở của mình');
    }

    vm.waiting = true;
    const supportEntry = new SupportEntries(vm.supportEntry);
    supportEntry.$save().then(() => {
      FhdMessenger.success('Tạo thành công');
      $state.reload();
      vm.waiting = false;
    }).catch(err => {
      FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(err);
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.update = function () {
    if (vm.newNote) {
      vm.supportEntry.note.push({
        content: vm.newNote,
        user: vm.user
      });
    }

    const supportEntry = vm.supportEntry;
    supportEntry.$update();
  };

  vm.done = function (supportEntry) {
    if (supportEntry) {
      supportEntry.$done();
    } else {
      vm.supportEntry.$done();
    }
  }; // Find a list of Customer requests


  vm.supportEntryTable = new NgTableParams({
    count: 50
  });

  vm.find = function () {
    const statuses = _.reduce(vm.statusMap, (statuses, toShow, status) => {
      if (toShow) statuses.push(status);
      return statuses;
    }, []);

    const outlets = _.reduce(vm.showOutletMap, (outlets, toShow, outlet) => {
      if (toShow) outlets.push(outlet);
      return outlets;
    }, []);

    vm.supportEntries = SupportEntries.query({
      statuses,
      outlets
    });
    vm.supportEntries.$promise.then(() => {
      vm.supportEntryTable.settings({
        dataset: vm.supportEntries
      });
    });
  };
}]);
'use strict'; // Support Entries service used to communicate Vouchers REST endpoints

