angular.module('work-positions').controller('WorkPositionsController', ['Authentication', 'WorkPositions', 'WorkDepartments', 'FhdMessenger', 'NgTableParams', 'ConfirmModal', 'UserService', '$stateParams', function (Authentication, WorkPositions, WorkDepartments, FhdMessenger, NgTableParams, ConfirmModal, UserService, $stateParams) {
  const vm = this;
  vm.authentication = Authentication;
  vm.user = Authentication.user;
  vm.workPositionsTable = new NgTableParams({
    count: 1000
  });
  vm.waiting = false;
  vm.data = {
    roleMap: {},
    featureRoles: {}
  };

  vm.init = () => {
    UserService.getRoleMap().then(roleMap => {
      vm.data.roleMap = roleMap;
    });
    UserService.getRolesInTypes().then(roleTypes => {
      const roleFeature = _.find(roleTypes, {
        id: 'features'
      });

      vm.data.featureRoles = roleFeature.roles;
    });
  };

  vm.find = () => {
    vm.workPositions = WorkPositions.query({});
    vm.workPositions.$promise.then(() => {
      vm.workPositionsTable.settings({
        dataset: vm.workPositions
      });
    });
  };

  vm.getWorkDepartment = () => {
    WorkDepartments.query({}).$promise.then(workDepartments => {
      vm.data.workDepartments = workDepartments;
    });
  };

  vm.findOne = async () => {
    WorkPositions.get({
      workPositionId: $stateParams.workPositionId
    }).$promise.then(data => {
      vm.workPosition = data;
      const roles = vm.workPosition.roles;

      _.forEach(roles, role => {
        vm.data.roleMap[role] = true;
      });
    });
  };

  const convertMapObjectToStringArray = map => {
    const keys = _.keys(map);

    const stringrray = _.filter(keys, key => map[key]);

    return stringrray;
  };

  vm.create = () => {
    if (!vm.workPosition.name) {
      return FhdMessenger.error('Thiếu tên vị trí');
    } // if (!vm.workPosition.workDepartment) {
    //   return FhdMessenger.error('Thiếu trường bộ phận')
    // }


    vm.waiting = true;
    vm.workPosition.roles = convertMapObjectToStringArray(vm.data.roleMap);
    const workPosition = new WorkPositions(vm.workPosition);
    workPosition.$save().then(res => {
      FhdMessenger.success('Tạo vị trí thành công !');
    }).catch(err => {
      FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(err);
    }).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.remove = workPosition => {
    ConfirmModal.show().then(() => {
      workPosition.$remove(() => {
        const workPositionIndex = _.findIndex(vm.workPositions, {
          _id: workPosition._id
        });

        if (workPositionIndex > -1) {
          vm.workPositions.splice(workPositionIndex, 1);
          vm.workPositionsTable.reload();
        }
      }, err => {
        FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(err);
      });
    });
  };

  vm.updateRole = () => {
    vm.waiting = true;
    vm.workPosition.roles = convertMapObjectToStringArray(vm.data.roleMap);
    vm.workPosition.$updateRole().then(() => FhdMessenger.success('Cập nhật role thành công!')).catch(err => {
      FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(err);
    }).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };

  vm.updateInfo = () => {
    vm.waiting = true;
    vm.workPosition.$updateInfo().then(() => FhdMessenger.success('Cập nhật thành công!')).catch(err => {
      FhdMessenger.errorFromServer(err);
    }).finally(() => {
      vm.waiting = false;
    });
  };
}]);
"use strict";

angular.module('work-positions').filter('filterWorkPositionInput', [function () {
  return function (workPositions, viewValue, workPositionSearch) {
    const lowerCaseViewValue = viewValue.toLowerCase();

    const matchWorkDepartment = _.find(workPositions, workPosition => workPosition.name.toLowerCase() === lowerCaseViewValue);

    if (matchWorkDepartment) {
      return [matchWorkDepartment];
    }

    if (workPositionSearch && viewValue !== workPositionSearch) {
      return _.filter(workPositions, workPosition => {
        return workPosition.name.toLowerCase().includes(lowerCaseViewValue);
      });
    }

    return workPositions;
  };
}]).directive('fhdWorkPositionInput', [function () {
  return {
    templateUrl: 'modules/work-positions/templates/fhd-work-position-input.client.template.html',
    restrict: 'AE',
    scope: {
      workPosition: '=?',
      labelColumn: '@',
      noLabel: '=?',
      label: '@',
      onChange: '=?',
      onSelect: '=?',
      breakpoint: '@'
    },
    controller: 'fhdWorkPositionInputController',
    controllerAs: 'vm',
    bindToController: true,

    link(scope, element) {
      const vm = scope.vm;

      if (vm.labelColumn) {
        vm.labelColumn = vm.labelColumn || 2;
        vm.breakpoint = vm.breakpoint || 'sm';
        const labelElm = element.find('label');
        const inputElm = element.find('fhd-controls');
        labelElm.addClass(`col-${vm.breakpoint}-${vm.labelColumn}`);
        inputElm.addClass(`col-${vm.breakpoint}-${12 - vm.labelColumn}`);
      }
    }

  };
}]).controller('fhdWorkPositionInputController', ['$scope', 'ObjectId', 'WorkPositionService', function ($scope, ObjectId, WorkPositionService) {
  const vm = this;
  const notSelected = '';
  vm.workPositionSearch = notSelected;
  vm.workPositions = [];
  vm.workPosition = vm.workPosition || null;
  vm.getWorkPositions = WorkPositionService.allAsync().then(workPositions => {
    return workPositions;
  });

  vm.handleRemove = () => {
    vm.workPosition = null;
    vm.workPositionSearch = '';
  };

  vm.selectWorkPosition = item => {
    vm.workPosition = item;

    if (vm.onSelect) {
      vm.onSelect(vm.workPosition);
    }
  };

  vm.getDefaultWorkPosition = () => {
    vm.getWorkPositions.then(function (workPositions) {
      vm.workPositions = workPositions;

      if (vm.workPosition) {
        const matchWorkPosition = _.find(workPositions, {
          _id: ObjectId.getObjectId(vm.workPosition)
        });

        if (matchWorkPosition) {
          return matchWorkPosition;
        }
      }
    }).then(workPosition => {
      vm.workPosition = workPosition;
      if (workPosition) vm.workPositionSearch = workPosition.name;
    });
  };

  $scope.$watch('vm.workPosition', (newValue, oldValue) => {
    if (newValue === oldValue) return;

    if (vm.onChange && newValue) {
      vm.onChange(newValue);
    }
  });
}]);
'use strict';

angular.module('work-positions').factory('WorkPositionService', ['WorkPositions', function (WorkPositions) {
  let workPositions;
  let avaiableWorkPositions;

  let loadAvaible = function () {
    avaiableWorkPositions = WorkPositions.query().$promise;
  };

  return {
    allAsync() {
      if (!avaiableWorkPositions) {
        loadAvaible();
      }

      return avaiableWorkPositions;
    },

    getWorkPositions() {
      if (!workPositions) workPositions = WorkPositions.query();
      return workPositions;
    }

  };
}]);
'use strict'; // Complaints service used to communicate Complaints REST endpoints

